# GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2 (certifi, emSign root removal). Added 2026-11-12.
# Applies to the CI vulnerability gate only; compare.sh and the test scripts do not use this file.
#
# Debian's python3-certifi (2025.1.31+ds, from the Debian allowlist) is patched so that
# certifi.where() returns the system bundle /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt, and the package
# ships no bundled cacert.pem. The emSign roots the advisory is about (emSign Root CA - G1,
# emSign Root CA - C1, emSign ECC Root CA - C3) are in the system bundle that comes from the DHI
# base (ca-certificates), so upgrading certifi would not change exposure.
# Revisit when DHI ships ca-certificates without those emSign roots, or when certifi leaves the
# allowlist.
GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2
